S1 -- data
======================================================================================================================
  Pantheon+ release table: 1701 light curves (real_research/data_cache/PantheonPlusSH0ES.dat)
    byte-identical copies in the repo: 3 (real_research/data_cache/PantheonPlusSH0ES.dat, prep_2026/sne_lambda/pantheonplus_full.dat, qwen_claude_field_theory/closure_2026/supernova_reaudit_2026/release.dat)
