      z     SN-only (this lane, prof 1s)     DESI DR2+CMB+P+ (1s, propagated)   repo record (DR1 chains)
   1.00                   [0.707, 1.760]                 0.989 [0.957, 1.022]                         --
   2.00                   [0.446, 2.890]                 0.874 [0.807, 0.946]                         --
